### Movies API - run these in Rider (click the green arrow next to a request).
### Start the app first. Run "Login" first: the token is stored and used by the other requests.
### Auth has only two endpoints: login and register. Other Identity endpoints (refresh, 2FA, ...) return 404.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Login as Alice (saves the token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@demo.com",
  "password": "Demo123!"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Login as Bob (saves the token - the requests below then run as Bob)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@demo.com",
  "password": "Demo123!"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Register a new user (400 if the e-mail is already taken)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carol@demo.com",
  "password": "Demo123!"
}

### List movies (no login needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies

### One movie with cast and reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/1

### Create a movie (a toast pops up in every open browser)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Arrival",
  "releaseYear": 2016,
  "durationMinutes": 116,
  "description": "A linguist is recruited to communicate with mysterious visitors.",
  "genreId": 1,
  "studioId": 2
}

> {% client.global.set("movieId", response.body.id); %}

### Update the movie
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/{{movieId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Arrival (updated)",
  "releaseYear": 2016,
  "durationMinutes": 116,
  "description": "Updated from Rider.",
  "genreId": 1,
  "studioId": 2
}

### Post a review (the movie page updates live)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": {{movieId}},
  "rating": 9,
  "comment": "Posted from Rider's HTTP client!"
}

### My reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Genres
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/genres

### Studios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/studios

### People
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/people?search=nolan

### Cast of movie 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cast?movieId=1

### Edit someone else's review -> 403 (logged in as Alice; review 2 belongs to Bob)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 1,
  "comment": "Should be forbidden"
}

### Without a token -> 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/genres
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Western" }

### Delete the movie created above
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/{{movieId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
